			"notes": "## Minecraft 26.3 compatibility\n\n### Updated\n- Updated Patrix Bonus Blocks for Minecraft 26.3.\n- Updated Fabric Loader, Fabric API, Loom, and Gradle compatibility.\n- Updated Patrix Bonus and Addon compatibility metadata for the 26.3 packs.\n\n### Fixed\n- Updated resource-manager integration for the Minecraft 26.3 resource API.\n- Fixed all 11 animated Sci-Fi Screens and Sci-Fi Floor Screens under Continuity 26.3.\n- Added runtime aliases that preserve Patrix animation metadata without bundling Patrix artwork.\n- Fixed and hardened the Patrix resource generator for 26.3 regeneration.\n- Preserved existing block IDs and Creative inventory ordering.\n\nPatrix resource packs are still required. Patrix Bonus Blocks does not redistribute Patrix artwork."
		},
