			"notes": "### Patrix Bonus Blocks v0.10.2\n\n#### Added\n\n- Sci-Fi floor screens can now also be placed on walls as thin surface panels.\n- Wall-mounted Sci-Fi panels remain upright on all four wall orientations.\n- Floor-mounted Sci-Fi panels now orient based on the player's facing direction.\n- All 11 Sci-Fi floor-screen variants support the new placement behavior.\n\n#### Updated\n\n- Reorganized the Patrix Bonus Blocks Creative inventory for easier browsing.\n- Grouped related building materials, decorative items, Sci-Fi screens, food items, terrain, and vegetation more logically.\n- Grouped full-block Sci-Fi screens separately from thin surface panels.\n- Updated resource generation and validation for the new Sci-Fi surface-panel behavior.\n\nExisting Sci-Fi panel registry IDs remain unchanged, and other carpet-type Patrix Bonus Blocks retain their normal floor-only placement behavior.\n\nPatrix resource packs are still required; PBB does not redistribute Patrix artwork."
		},
