			"notes": "### Patrix Bonus Blocks v0.10.1\n\n**Patrix Update 91 compatibility**\n\n#### Added\n\n- 48 dedicated, individually selectable food bowls covering 16 food contents across all three Update 91 Patrix bowl shapes.\n- 16-position bowl placement with 22.5° rotation increments for precise decoration.\n\n#### Updated\n\n- Updated food basket resources for Patrix's Bonus → Addon move in Update 91.\n- Updated pack compatibility validation for the current Update 91 Bonus and Addon packs.\n- Standardized food crate, food basket, and food bowl display names.\n\n#### Fixed\n\n- Corrected placement orientation of the new Bowl 2 and Bowl 3 geometries using their Patrix-authored model pivots.\n\nPatrix's original randomized resin-wall food bowls and naturally selected food-basket behavior remain unchanged.\n\nPatrix resource packs are still required; PBB does not redistribute Patrix artwork."
